{"Title":"An Act increasing the term of office for select board members in the town of Marblehead from 1 year to 3 years","BillNumber":"S2652","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"BPC0","Name":"Brendan P. Crighton","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BPC0","ResponseDate":"2024-02-13T11:00:09.33"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"BPC0","Name":"Brendan P. Crighton","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BPC0","ResponseDate":"2024-02-13T11:00:09.33"},{"Id":"JBA1","Name":"Jennifer Balinsky Armini","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JBA1","ResponseDate":"2023-07-10T15:42:18.9266667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2652/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"Senate, February 15, 2024 - Substituted as a new draft (Senator Crighton) for the Senate Bill increasing the term of office for select board members in the town of Marblehead from 1 year to 3 years (Senate, No. 2407).","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. (a) Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the term of office for select board members in the town of Marblehead shall be increased from 1-year to 3-year staggered terms.\r\n\t(b) At the first annual town election to be held 1 year after the effective date of this act, the 3-member select board shall be elected. The 2 candidates receiving the highest number of votes shall each serve a 3-year term, the candidate receiving the third highest number of votes and the candidate receiving the fourth highest number of votes shall each serve a 2-year term and the candidate receiving the fifth highest number of votes shall serve a 1-year term. At all subsequent elections, as the terms of select board members expire, successors to that office shall be elected for 3-year terms.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.”\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}